// 16x16 toroid game, as described in the problem description. Implemented as
// an EDGE-triggered combinational function: each cell's next state is
// determined exactly by its current state and the current states of its
// neighbours. The register stage is omitted, so the game state is updated
// on the same clock cycle as the combinational function.
module TopModule(input clk, input load, input [255:0] data, output [255:0] q);
